WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
This guy over here in Germany,

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.961
Rudolf Diesel, invented

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:05.088
an engine that changed everything.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.923
This new engine mixed pressure,

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:07.465
and air,

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:09.759
and fossil fuels that all exploded

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:10.927
and made things move.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.345
This changed a lot of industries.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.138
But the Germans were like,

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.597
“Let's put these in submarines

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:15.890
and run them to charge

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.850
a bunch of batteries

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.101
that we can use to power

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.644
the sub while we're underwater.”

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:21.312
“It's a lot better than the hand-crank.”

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:22.188
And indeed it was.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.857
But there was one big problem,

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.399
which is that

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.859
this engine needs air, like,

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.110
it needs to be able to pump out

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.028
the exhaust that it makes

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.779
and it needs to be able to suck in air to

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:30.613
make energy.

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:31.614
So you can't actually run

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:32.699
your engines underwater.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.035
So these German subs, as stealthy as they

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.411
were, were still very limited

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.871
because they could only stay under water

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.081
for like 48 hours max before

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:40.790
having to come up

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.167
and give away their position

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.168
so that they could get air

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.044
for their engines.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.836
This is a problem

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.046
that will soon be solved,

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.881
but we just need a few wars first.

